# The Starter Map's Parts Gallery 3 (map 128; Parts Gallery 4 is map 129): the 104 models imported for
# 1.5.6 from the purchased packs, on two levelled gravel yards. Software rendering, so the depth buffer
# the close-up check reads is the frame's own. Tubes: parts156.
world custom "custom maps/Starter Map.rmc"
map-name Parts Gallery 3
camera 12 23 -999 -90 -8
scenery-only
software
size 1280 720
frames 4
